[0m15:02:56.974349 [debug] [Thread-6 (]: BigQuery adapter: https://console.cloud.google.com/bigquery?project=parnasa-498503&j=bq:EU:73d2cb6d-d991-4bee-82d7-915bc9e0965a&page=queryresults
